&control
    calculation = 'scf'
    pseudo_dir = 'pseudo/'
    outdir='./out/'
    prefix='si_extreme'
/
&system
    ibrav = 0, 
    nat = 1, 
    ntyp = 1,
    ecutwfc = 30.0
/
&electrons
    conv_thr = 1.0d-8
/
&AUTO_OPTIMIZE
  optimize_kpoints = .false.
  optimize_cutoff = .false.
/
ATOMIC_SPECIES
 Si  28.086  Si_r.upf
CELL_PARAMETERS (bohr)
  50.0  0.0  0.0   ! Very elongated cell
   0.0  5.0  0.0
   0.0  0.0  5.0
ATOMIC_POSITIONS (bohr)
 Si 25.0 2.5 2.5
K_POINTS gamma